      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Although several studies that evaluate the effectiveness of active and passive immunization in SCI are available, conflicting findings have been reported between studies... These inconsistencies have made it impossible to draw a general conclusion in this regard.",
      "reason": "The introduction describes current knowledge (existing studies, mechanisms, treatments) and explicitly identifies uncertainties and conflicting findings."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Hence, the present study aims to perform a systematic review and meta-analysis to determine the effectiveness of passive or active immunization with MBP on motor recovery in animal models following SCI.",
      "reason": "The need for the review is explained: inconsistent findings and unclear comparative effectiveness motivate the systematic review and meta-analysis."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No similar prior systematic review is cited or mentioned in the retrieved evidence; the review appears to be presented as the first of its kind, so no update/replication justification is required."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "These studies indicate that the presence of immune T cells in the injury site increases secretion of nervous growth factors, improves the tissue environment surrounding the damaged neurons, protects the remaining myelin, and eventually, leads to enhancement of motor recovery (4).",
      "reason": "The introduction briefly describes the proposed mechanism of action of immunization with MBP (T-cell mediated neuroprotection, growth factor secretion, myelin protection)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "This is a preclinical animal meta-analysis of a relatively simple immunization intervention; no logic model is presented and none appears required for this context."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
}

